---
source: src/tui/view.rs
expression: "rows.join(\"\\n\")"
---
 ?  ┌LEGEND───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐34:56
┌SES│ ↑           served on a newer model: bright on the latest turn, dim earlier             │────┐
│ses│ $           released past the armed quota gate for this window                          │idle│
│ses│ %           released to the end of the plan, stopping before overage                    │  1m│
│ses│ !           stopped: the last thing this session got was a gate notice                  │  1m│
│… 2│ ✗           failed: this session's newest finished request ended in failure             │    │
└───│ ~           routed to this model, none served yet                                       │────┘
┌CON│ ↺           compactions so far; - for none                                              │────┐
│ses│ -           not reported, which is not zero                                             │    │
│ses│ ?           unknown: model, context ceiling, or token count                             │    │
│… 2│ ≥           a floor: some rows unknown, or the span predates the data                   │    │
└───│ <1%         spent less than the meter's 1% step shows; 0% is none at all                │────┘
┌TOK│ ·           no requests in that slice of the window; red holds an error                 │────┐
│fre│ ‹N          N accounts hidden to the left of the meters shown                           │    │
│cac│ … N more    N accounts hidden to the right                                              │    │
│cac│ on track    the meter resets before it runs out                                         │    │
│cac│ estimating  too little data to separate burn from noise                                 │    │
│out│ stops ~T    reaches the armed gate's threshold at T                                     │    │
│hit│ out ~T      runs out at T                                                               │ix  │
│mis│ gated ·     past the gate; the countdown is to exhaustion                               │    │
└───│ on track?   a trailing ?: the gate's state is assumed, not observed                     │────┘
┌CAC│ last req    green under 30s, yellow under 5m, red beyond                                │────┐
│2 o│ ctx         green: native 1M; yellow: another known ceiling                             │    │
│sys│ idle        dim once a session has been quiet 3m                                        │    │
│new│ ‖ ⇡ ⇣       in flight: not yet sent, awaiting a reply, or streaming; timed from arrival │    │
│· s│ bold ⇣      one other request in flight beside it                                       │    │
└───│ cyan ⇣      two or more others in flight beside it                                      │────┘
┌RAT│ KEYS                                                                                    │────┐
│  r│ … 5 more                                                                                │    │
└───└? or esc close───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘────┘
